  "generator": "aero-engine sample content (authored here) -- task 3.5.1: an 8-segment x 11-ring tube of radius 0.25 running 2 units along +Y, deformed by five joints J0..J4 in a plain chain at y = 0, 0.4, 0.8, 1.2 and 1.6. J0 is a scene root, so the cook's ancestor closure adds nothing and the cooked skeleton is exactly five records. Inverse bind matrices are translation(0, -jointY, 0), hand-derivable from that chain. Vertex weights are a linear blend between the two nearest joints, so JOINTS_0 carries two live entries per vertex and WEIGHTS_0 sums to 1. Every node is TRS-form and the buffer is embedded, so this file is self-contained and its cook is deterministic."
